    "text": "I, M. M. P. Priyangani Pethangoda, Divisional Secretary, Kegalle of Kegalle District, do hereby give Notice under Section 33 (Chapter 460) of the Land Acquisition Act, that the amount of Rupees Twenty Three Million One Hundred Twenty Six Thousand One Hundred Twenty Five(Rs. 2,31,26,125.00) which is staturoy compensation for the land acquired for the state as described in the following Schedule is deposited against the Case No. LA/467/2025 of the District Court of Kegalle in order to give to Owners.",
